-- ============================================================================
--  mapcoords_seed.sql — GENERATED
--
--  Fills in <prefix>_mapcoords for every place whose stored Google Maps link
--  could be resolved to an exact pin. Each coordinate comes from following that
--  row's OWN curated link and reading the place marker out of the resolved URL
--  (the !3d<lat>!4d<lng> values) — not from a name search.
--
--  Cross-checked against the previously hand-verified kltg_mapcoords.php /
--  beyondkl_mapcoords.php: 130 titles overlap and all agree to within 200 m.
--
--  Rows whose link is missing, is not a Google Maps link, or resolved to a
--  Google search page are deliberately left NULL: they keep the old fallback
--  behaviour, and an admin can now fill them in from the Map Coordinates field
--  on the edit modal.
--
--  Keyed on title, so it is safe to apply before OR after
--  primarykey_migration.sql, and safe to re-run.
--
--  ORDER: mapcoords_migration.sql  ->  this file  ->  primarykey_migration.sql
--
--  MEMO for the next dev — full file map is in PROJECT_GUIDE.md
-- ============================================================================

